sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Warehouse Manager
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant SHIP as Shipment Service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant ANA as Analytics Service
  participant NOTIF as Notification Service
  User->>GW: POST /api/shipments/{id}/delivered
  GW->>SHIP: Forward delivery update
  SHIP->>SHIP: Mark DELIVERED
  SHIP->>MQ: Publish shipment.delivered
  MQ->>ANA: Persist delivery event
  MQ->>NOTIF: Store delivery notification

